---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'May 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Chillax Creek"
  description="How Chillax Creek collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h6 class="red-heading">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</h6>
      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        This policy describes what information Chillax Creek collects when you use our website or
        book a stay, and how that information is used and protected.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="legal-article">
        <h3>What we collect</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> when you fill out our contact form, we
          collect your name, email, message, and any optional fields you choose to provide. These
          submissions are delivered to our inbox via Formspree and are used only to respond to
          your inquiry.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Newsletter signups:</strong> when you subscribe, we collect your email address
          and use it only to send occasional updates about Chillax Creek. You can unsubscribe at
          any time using the link in the email.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Booking information:</strong> when you book through our site, OwnerRez (our
          booking provider) collects the information needed to process the reservation, including
          your name, contact details, payment information, and stay dates. See the
          <a href="https://www.ownerreservations.com/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OwnerRez privacy policy</a>
          for details.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Site analytics:</strong> we may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand
          how visitors find and use our site. We do not sell or share this information.
        </p>

        <h3>How we use it</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your inquiries and confirm bookings</li>
          <li>To send you the newsletter you signed up for</li>
          <li>To improve our site, content, and guest experience</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations (tax reporting, etc.)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Who we share with</h3>
        <p>
          We share your information only with the service providers needed to operate the site
          and your booking — currently OwnerRez (bookings &amp; payment), Formspree (contact
          form), and any email service we use to send the newsletter. We do not sell your
          information.
        </p>

        <h3>Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          This site itself sets very few cookies. The OwnerRez booking widget may set cookies to
          remember your search and preferences during checkout. You can clear or block cookies
          through your browser settings — note that doing so may limit some features (e.g., the
          availability calendar may not remember your dates between page loads).
        </p>

        <h3>Cameras at the property</h3>
        <p>
          For security, exterior cameras cover the driveway and main entry of the property.
          <strong>There are no cameras inside the cabin or in any private outdoor area</strong>
          (hot tub, fire pit area, balconies, fenced backyard portions). Exterior camera footage
          is retained for a short period and used only for security and incident review.
        </p>

        <h3>How long we keep data</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Contact form messages: kept indefinitely in our inbox unless you ask us to delete them</li>
          <li>Newsletter list: until you unsubscribe</li>
          <li>Booking records: kept as long as required by tax and accounting law</li>
          <li>Camera footage: typically rotated within 14–30 days</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Your rights</h3>
        <p>
          You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal information we
          hold about you. To do so, <a href="/contact-us/">contact us</a> and we&rsquo;ll respond
          within a reasonable time.
        </p>

        <h3>Contact</h3>
        <p>
          Questions about this privacy policy? Reach out via the
          <a href="/contact-us/">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
